    heading: "What a Deira catalogue site starts at",
    note: `A catalogue site of up to 100 pages starts from ${P.site}. Once the range runs past a few hundred items and you want each one indexable, the generated-catalogue build starts from ${P.seoSite}. A store with a working checkout starts from ${P.shop}, a buyer portal with order history and credit limits starts from ${P.software}, and an Android app, which almost no Deira wholesaler needs before the website is working, starts from ${P.app}. What moves the figure is not the number of items, because generated pages cost roughly the same whether there are four hundred or four thousand. It is the number of distinct layouts, how clean your price list is, whether you need a second and third language, and whether buyer accounts have to talk to your accounting system. Everything is quoted as a line in USD, nothing is billed before you approve the quote in writing, and the comparison against local rates sits on <a href='/uae/website-cost-dubai-vs-india/'>website cost in Dubai versus India</a>.`,
